'''Aku Studies 201: Inquiry''' is the fourth and final stage in [[Empress' Report 2]]. This stage can only be cleared once. When cleared for the first time, it drops an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] [[Aku Catfruit Seed|Catfruit Seed]], while also unlocking [[Empress' Report 3]], which drops another [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] [[Aku Catfruit Seed|Catfruit Seed]].

