==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Take your time in the beginning and try not to rush [[Scissoroo]]. Instead, use [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] to freeze and stall her while building up money. After she is dead, spam all your units and start fighting. You should send out general damage dealers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] out first then send your anti-zombie units, like [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] or [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]]. This way, you can have your front stack stall the [[Nimoy Bore]] or outright kill it while your anti-zombie stack deal with the burrowing zombies.

You should bring [[Holy Blast]] for the zombies to unburrow the [[Zuche|Zuches]] or [[Zir Zeal|Zir Zeals]] if possible, albeit not necessary since they are not that buffed.

